  "notes": "The shiny seed the classic Alpha can leave behind: the run's seed drawn again (the same shape, sprout, highlight, outline and shadow) with its body and sprout shimmering through the rainbow, one hue per frame: red, orange, yellow-green, green, teal, blue, purple, magenta. The sprout runs two hues ahead of the body, the way a shiny monster's lighter colors run ahead of its darker ones, and the white highlight stays, a gleam. Frames 1 and 2 add the seed's side twinkle. Every color comes from the effects palette (pal_fx) instead of a shimmering palette copy: the run scene already uses all 16 sprite palettes.",
